<item>
<title>{5MasterCode</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14908</link>
<description>Trained for health, and after much pissing about, managed to find it, and some weird scale value for the bar.. Put a break on write to find the code that does the sub for the health. It's global.. So everyone is invincible! Did a break on read.. Found 2 places.. Nopped them out and found the read for the health bar. These are drawn in red (enemy) and blue (friend) so something knows which is which. Found it's a flag stored in S2. So, wrote a small patch that fills up health if S2 = 0. Noticed that next words along was affinity, so included space for them in the wrapper.</description>
